title: 16-bit mov/add encodings inside an IT block don't set flags
ref: A8.8 IT; A2.5.2 ITSTATE: each instruction in the block is conditional on its own condition; A8.8 MOV (immediate) T1 and ADD (register) T1: setflags = !InITBlock()

[code]
04bf        itt eq
0020        moveq r0, #0
8918        addeq r1, r1, r2
7047        bx lr

[in]
r0 = 5
r1 = 1
r2 = 0xFFFFFFFF
flags = nZcV

[out]
r0 = 0
r1 = 0
